            <description><![CDATA[
<h3>Small fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>The change follows the range</b> — the percentage next to your MRR now describes the chart below it: 24H, 7D, 1Y or your own dates, instead of always the last 30 days.</li>
<li><b>Closes when you click away</b> — the popover now closes on a click in any other app.</li>
<li><b>Version in the header</b> — the version you are running is shown at the top.</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
